      "content": "the numbers just don't add up. everything i've tried has failed. it's not just the money, it's the shame of it all. i look at my family and i just feel like a failure. like a burden. i feel like i'm just stuck in this loop of failing over and over and there's no way to fix it. it's just a constant weight on my chest.",
